  <!-- Privacy Policy Modal -->
  <dialog id="privacy-dialog" class="legal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h3 class="modal-title">Privacy Policy</h3>
      <button class="modal-close-btn" id="privacy-close-btn" aria-label="Close dialog">✕</button>
    </div>
    <p class="legal-dialog-meta">The Schools of India Summit 2026 · Last updated: September 2026</p>
    <div class="legal-dialog-body">
      <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
      <p>When you register, request a call back, become a sponsor, download the schedule, or subscribe to updates, we collect the details you provide — typically your name, email, phone number, school or organisation, and designation.</p>
      <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
      <p>We use this information to process your registration and enquiries, respond to sponsorship and call-back requests, send you the Summit schedule and event updates, and improve the Summit experience.</p>
      <h4>3. Third-Party Services</h4>
      <p>Ticket registration is processed by TezTicket, and 5% Showcase submissions are collected via Google Forms. These providers have their own privacy policies governing the information you give them directly.</p>
      <h4>4. Data Security</h4>
      <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.</p>
      <h4>5. Your Rights</h4>
      <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. Contact us at <a href="mailto:summit@theschoolsofindia.org" style="color:var(--color-magenta);">summit@theschoolsofindia.org</a> to exercise these rights.</p>
      <h4>6. Changes to This Policy</h4>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be posted on this page.</p>
      <h4>7. Contact</h4>
      <p>For privacy questions about the Summit, contact <a href="mailto:summit@theschoolsofindia.org" style="color:var(--color-magenta);">summit@theschoolsofindia.org</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <!-- Terms & Conditions Modal -->
  <dialog id="terms-dialog" class="legal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h3 class="modal-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h3>
      <button class="modal-close-btn" id="terms-close-btn" aria-label="Close dialog">✕</button>
    </div>
    <p class="legal-dialog-meta">The Schools of India Summit 2026 · Last updated: September 2026</p>
    <div class="legal-dialog-body">
      <h4>1. Acceptance of Terms</h4>
      <p>By registering for or attending The Schools of India Summit 2026, you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not register.</p>
      <h4>2. Registration &amp; Ticketing</h4>
      <p>Tickets are sold and processed by TezTicket, a third-party ticketing platform. Payment, refund, and transfer requests are subject to TezTicket's own terms and policies.</p>
      <h4>3. Event Changes</h4>
      <p>TSOI may modify the schedule, speakers, tracks, or venue where necessary. Registrants will be notified of any material changes ahead of the event.</p>
      <h4>4. Media &amp; Photography</h4>
      <p>By attending, you consent to being photographed and filmed for TSOI's promotional and archival use, including Summit stage recordings, session photography, and 5% Showcase presentation videos.</p>
      <h4>5. Code of Conduct</h4>
      <p>Attendees are expected to behave respectfully toward speakers, delegates, and staff. TSOI reserves the right to refuse entry or remove any attendee who violates this.</p>
      <h4>6. Intellectual Property</h4>
      <p>All TSOI branding, content, and materials are the property of The Schools of India and may not be reproduced without permission. Practices submitted to the 5% Showcase remain owned by the contributing school under the Showcase's own terms.</p>
      <h4>7. Limitation of Liability</h4>
      <p>TSOI shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your registration for or attendance at the Summit.</p>
      <h4>8. Changes to Terms</h4>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued registration or attendance after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
      <h4>9. Contact</h4>
      <p>For questions about these terms, contact <a href="mailto:summit@theschoolsofindia.org" style="color:var(--color-magenta);">summit@theschoolsofindia.org</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <% if Rails.env.development? %>
  <button class="cms-panel-btn" id="cms-toggle-btn" aria-label="Open CMS Panel">⚙</button>
